CONDITION 2: THE CREDIT LINE STAYS ON SCREEN

SlantUI draws a credit line in the title bar of every window it builds. It
reads:

    Layout by Federico Salerno

You may not remove it, hide it, cover it, make it transparent, shrink it below
the size SlantUI sets, or change its text. It has to stay legible in the
running application, on every screen the application shows, for as long as the
application uses any part of SlantUI's look.

Everything else about your application is yours. Rename it, restyle it, change
every colour, sell it, keep the source closed. The credit line is the only
thing that has to survive.

If you want the line gone, write to f.efi.salerno@gmail.com and ask for a
licence without it.


